   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Au lieu de, plutôt que",
     "texto": [
      "**Au lieu de** + infinitive means «en vez de» (instead of): **Au lieu de travailler, tu dors** (instead of working, you sleep).",
      "**Plutôt que** + infinitive also indicates a choice: **Je prends le train plutôt que la voiture** (I take the train rather than the car)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Grâce à, à cause de",
     "texto": [
      "**Grâce à** (thanks to) usually introduces a cause in a way that is favorable for the speaker; **à cause de** usually presents the result as unfavorable: **Grâce à toi, je fais du sport** (thanks to you, I do sport)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
